@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+# Bounded Suwayomi activity logs
+
+Suwayomi, its GraphQL filter, and its daily scheduler share a 20,000,000-byte
+log budget at `/storage/emulated/0/Suwayomi/logs`. The ring contains
+`suwayomi.log` and up to nine 2,000,000-byte archives. Records include their
+service, timestamp, existing server events/errors, and filter operation/status/
+timing metadata. Request bodies, credentials, and response bodies are omitted.
+
+Detached capture drains bounded records from service stdout/stderr. Java remains
+the directly managed service PID. Normal file writes fail closed; an unavailable
+capture reader does not terminate Java. Android shared storage rejects `flock`,
+so its zero-byte coordination lock lives in private Termux cache instead.
+
+The `suwayomi-bounded-logging` release profile permits changes only to the JAR,
+supervisor, filter, scheduler, and log helper. It validates the complete manifest,
+preserves exact launcher/catalog compatibility pins, stops only the three
+Suwayomi services and supervisor, installs reviewed files, and imports the exact
+owned legacy logs while producers remain stopped. It then restarts only services
+that were enabled. Disabled markers and unrelated services retain their state.
+
+Offline import includes known application archives, filter/scheduler logs, and
+Suwayomi supervisor output. It redacts bounded batches, syncs retained logs, and
+removes originals only after successful persistence. Failed imports remain
+retryable. Old log data is never copied into Git or release manifests.
+
+Run focused checks with:
+
+```sh
+python3 -m unittest tests.test_suwayomi_logs tests.test_suwayomi_logging_acceptance tests.test_suwayomi_capture_lifecycle tests.test_release_activation tests.test_activation_native tests.test_supervisor tests.test_suwayomi_filter tests.test_suwayomi_lifecycle
+```
+
+Keep the custom v2.4.2366 JAR as the overlay base. Do not replace it with an
+upstream release. Package the minimal logging class patch separately, then use a
+complete reviewed release bundle and fresh live preconditions for activation.
